OL,3,GNEWSAProlific shoplifters behind more
OL,4,Athan 28,000 offences, BBC finds
OL,5,
OL,6,FAt the height of his offending, Jeff
OL,7,FAshman estimates he walked out of shops
OL,8,Fwith goods worth #400 to #500 on a
OL,9,Fdaily basis.
OL,11,F"It's mind-boggling," he said,
OL,12,Fdescribing how much he had stolen from
OL,13,Fstores in Hastings to fuel his
OL,14,Faddiction to heroin and crack cocaine.
OL,16,F"I know the misery and grief and
OL,17,Fdespair that I have caused these people
OL,18,Ffor a long period of time."
